# A runner on its own file's gaits (UAL1's Rigify mannequin): a stand, and
# its walk, jog and sprint blended by speed, each at its measured speed;
# moving above 0.25 m/s, standing again below 0.1 (the showcase's runner and
# climber, ae3d.character.graphed).
take idle Idle_Loop
take walk Walk_Loop
take jog Jog_Fwd_Loop
take sprint Sprint_Loop
state idle idle loop
blend move speed
  walk measured
  jog measured
  sprint measured
end
transition idle move 0.35
  when speed above 0.25
end
transition move idle 0.4
  when speed below 0.1
end
play idle
